WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — rce-vc (ig) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.763
<v Narrator>N'oge mbụ, ọtụtụ ndị mmadụ na AI ndị ọrụ depụta n'otu oge, na aha a nyochaa na-anabata mgbanwe ma ọ bụ ndekọ ihe kpatara ya.

2
00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:21.602
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, ịtụle ọrụ aha-enweghị n'ebe ngwe ndị ahụ nọ na-enye ohere ka mgbanwe ndị a na-adịghị emetụta ya gaa n'otu ebe ọbụla na-enweghị mmegharị ụgha.

3
00:00:21.682 --> 00:00:31.090
<v Narrator>Nke atọ, ndị mmepe na-adịgide na Git dị ka ọ bụla n'ihi na ịlele ihe karịrị otu puku ihe na-ewe microseconds iri na asaa.
